 ],
 "strings": {
  "Can I ask you one thing?": "",
  "What are your feelings toward Nanami? You keep asking her out because you're interested in her, right?": "",
  "I am.": "",
  "What do you mean \"you think so\"?": "",
  "Hmm, I'm not 100% sure yet.": "",
  "Well then make up your mind!": "",
  "Okay, then I am interested.": "",
  "I'm definitely interested in her.": "",
  "Does that mean you like her?": "",
  "I guess you can say that.": "",
  "Okay then.": "",
  "Can we meet up right now? I want to talk to you about this some more.": "",
  "I'll be waiting at Wette Kitchen on West Taihei Boulevard!": "",
  "Thanks for waiting, Yukko-san.": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. You're looking as handsome as always.": "",
  "So, about Nanami-san...": "",
  "Looks like even you couldn't penetrate her icy facade.": "",
  "What a waste... missing the chance to get to know a wonderful guy like you.": "",
  "Well, if she's not interested, then there's not much I can do.": "",
  "Don't think like that, Yagami-san! My instincts have been telling me she's actually really into you!": "",
  "You sure about that?": "",
  "100% sure. What I think is happening is that she's getting too caught up in her past. So she's closing herself off.": "",
  "What happened to her?": "",
  "Umm... I'm not really at liberty to bring that up. Even to a nice guy like you.": "",
  "I see. That's too bad.": "",
  "...Okay, this is just between me and you!": "",
  "Whoa. You're gonna tell me after all?": "",
  "...I can't help it! You see, I'm just too much of a blabbermouth, and you're too much of a hottie!": "",
  "Then I'm glad I was born with these charming good looks.": "",
  "But you have to swear on your life that you didn't hear this from me. Okay?": "",
  "I can't promise that.": "",
  "Hmm. Not sure I can do that.": "",
  "Then my lips are sealed.": "",
  "...I figured as much.": "",
  "You really don't want to know?": "",
  "Fine, I swear.": "",
  "All right. I'll hold you to that, then.": "",
  "Okay, here's what happened.": "",
  "So Nanami had this really awful boyfriend—I'm talking major sleazeball here—that went and cheated on her.": "",
  "Sounds like a real bastard.": "",
  "He was. I'm not sure what Nanami saw in him, but she basically gave him her heart.": "",
  "And what did he end up doing? He threw it away like it was nothing! After that, a messy breakup ensued.": "",
  "That's terrible...": "",
  "Yup. Left such a deep emotional scar, it changed my friend forever.": "",
  "So that's how it was.": "",
  "So I guess it's not such a good time to ask her out, huh?": "",
  "After meeting a wonderful guy like you, I honestly thought she'd be able to move forward.": "",
  "...I see.": "",
  "Yagami-san. Do you really like Nanami?": "",
  "I think I like her.": "",
  "I am attracted to her.": "",
  "I wonder...": "",
  "Stop being so vague. Nothing will happen if you're like that!": "",
  "Y-You do have a point.": "",
  "Yeah, I think I like her.": "",
  "Would you be comfortable dating her?": "",
  "Yeah, I do want to date her.": "",
  "You're serious?": "",
  "I've been attracted to her for a while now.": "",
  "And would you say your feelings for her will only grow deeper and deeper?": "",
  "Yeah, I would say so.": "",
  "...Okay. Then I've decided to help you out!": "",
  "Thanks. But how?": "",
  "You'll need an excuse to slip past her defenses.": "",
  "An excuse...?": "",
  "Yeah. Something work-related, for example. Nanami just <font_kind=yakuza_italic>looooves</font_kind> her job.": "",
  "Since she's so anti-dating at the moment, it might work better if you got to know her as a \"colleague.\"": "",
  "You think so? But I work as a detective. We're worlds apart.": "",
  "A detective... okay, I can work with that. Give me a moment.": "",
  "Aha! Okay, I think I've got the perfect plan!": "",
  "How about you take her on an investigation?": "",
  "What? I can't do that...": "",
  "Why not? All you have to do is say she's your assistant. Besides, she seems to really dig your career.": "",
  "But I don't have anything going on right now that'll make it seem legitimate.": "",
  "...Hmm, okay then...": "",
  "Ohhh! I know!": "",
  "You thought up something else?": "",
  "Yeah! This is right out of a scene from one of my favorite movies!": "",
  "A detective and a woman he's working with pretend to be a couple to avoid drawing suspicion from their target...": "",
  "At first it's a fake romance, but the two gradually start getting to know each other... in various <font_kind=yakuza_italic>intimate</font_kind> ways.": "",
  "You're not saying...": "",
  "It's exactly what I'm saying!": "",
  "We're gonna ask Nanami to act as your girlfriend and pretend like it's part of an investigation!": "",
  "...I knew it.": "",
  "Yeah! And in that movie, those two actually end up falling in love.": "",
  "Then they end up living a happy life together! Doesn't that sound like a dream come true?": "",
  "Maybe... but I don't think that tactic will work on anything I'm involved in.": "",
  "O-Okay, then... Let's not stop there... I feel like we're so close...!": "",
  "Ohhhh! Hey, what about this!?": "",
  "You really are creative, aren't you...": "",
  "Darn straight. When you're a talented actress like me, all the world's a stage and everyone's a player.": "",
  "What does that have to do with anything?": "",
  "Because assuming a needed role is what I was born to do! As such, I've amassed a nice collection of props and disguises.": "",
  "Are you saying...": "",
  "I'll be the target for your investigation! That way you and Nanami can do the whole pretend couples thing!": "",
  "My role shall be that of a desperate housewife looking for love in all the wrong places... ❤": "",
  "No, no, <font_kind=yakuza_italic>no</font_kind>. That is a perfect recipe for failure.": "",
  "You mean the perfect opportunity to capture Nanami's heart! Trust me, there's no way anything can go wrong!": "",
  "Think about the excitement here! The thrill of working close together on a case... the rush of avoiding danger!": "",
  "Hmm, but even with a good disguise... I still feel like she'll recognize you.": "",
  "Here. Maybe a photo will sway your opinion.": "",
  "This is one of my more generic roles, too.": "",
  "Oh. Damn.": "",
  "Not only can I alter my appearance, I can also change my mannerisms. The way I walk, how I speak... everything!": "",
  "That's why I'm telling you, she definitely won't find out.": "",
  "If this is your level of quality... this might actually work.": "",
  "See? I even have a friend from my theater group who can act as my accomplice. So we've got all our bases covered.": "",
  "Let's do this.": "",
  "I don't know...": "",
  "Okay then. Let's do this.": "",
  "All you have to do is invite Nanami out and give me the good word!": "",
  "I'm sure you'll be able to get those hormones flowing... and help her blossom into a lady who knows the meaning of love!": "",
  "(I hope this turns out okay...)": "",
  "I'd honestly rather not trick her.": "",
  "Well, of course not... Unfortunately, I think this is the only way to get to her.": "",
  "Hmm. Is that really the case...?": "",
  "Geez, you are super indecisive, you know that? Contact me whenever you've made up your mind.": "",
  "Okay, I will.": "",
  "(Okay. All I need to do is ask Nanami-san out.)": "",
  "Hi! What's up, Yagami-san?": "",
  "(Should I go through with this? There's no going back from here...)": "",
  "Ask her to help.": "",
  "Oh, nothing. Just saying hi.": "",
  "Oh. Then hi! Lol": "",
  "I actually wanted to ask you. Can you help me out with an investigation?": "",
  "You mean like one of your Side Cases?": "",
  "Yeah. I'm investigating an infidelity case, but my target is starting to catch on to me. So I need to throw her off somehow.": "",
  "That's where you come in. By pretending to be a couple, we can blend in with the environment and avoid suspicion.": "",
  "Ooh, that sounds really exciting! Count me in!": "",
  "(Whoa. She really jumped at the chance, huh?)": "",
  "I'm serious, I'm totally down to help however I can!": "",
  "(Perfect!)": "",
  "Now let's go get that cheater!": "",
  "That's the plan. I'll contact you when I'm ready to go.": "",
  "(She seems really fired up about this... I should report this to Yukko-san.)": "",
  "Hey, remember that outfit I gave you? I bet that would help us look the part.": "",
  "I was debating on that myself. But I think you're right, so I'll wear it!": "",
  "(Nah, that'd be overkill.)": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san. I wanted to thank you for the valuable experience today. And for listening to me.": "",
  "No, thank you for cooperating with me.": "",
  "Did you report your findings to the client?": "",
  "Yeah, I did.": "",
  "And? Are they going to split up?": "",
  "Not sure. I'm leaving that up to the client to decide.": "",
  "I see, so you don't step in that deep. But I think it's better to break up with someone who cheats on their partner!": "",
  "No, not yet. It's not that easy to break the news.": "",
  "I understand...": "",
  "When you find out what happens, please tell me!": "",
  "So, how's everything going with Nanami? Good, I hope?": "",
  "So far, so good. I think she'll probably go out with me again.": "",
  "Yay! So our plan worked!": "",
  "I still feel bad lying to her, though.": "",
  "You aren't doing anything bad, Yagami-san. Besides, I pushed you to do this.": "",
  "And I agreed to do it. Well, what's more important is what happens next.": "",
  "That's right! You gotta ask her out!": "",
  "I mentioned this during our investigation the other day, but do you want to hang out together?": "",
  "Yes, I'd love to!": "",
  "(Awesome! I did it!)": "",
  "Just to make sure, it'll just be the two of us, right?": "",
  "Of course lol I won't bring Yukko this time.": "",
  "Cool.": "",
  "Um, can we go out for dinner tonight?": "",
  "Sure. Should we meet up at our usual place? In front of the arcade at Theater Square?": "",
  "Absolutely! See you there.": "",
  "(Great. Then I'll head over there once it's time.)": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san!": "",
  "Whoa. Check <font_kind=yakuza_italic>you</font_kind> out.": "",
  "Hehe, I decided to spice things up a bit. So, what do you think?": "",
  "You look cute.": "",
  "You look gorgeous.": "",
  "I think you look cute.": "",
  "Why thank you.": "",
  "It really fits you, Nanami-san. In fact, it's almost as gorgeous as you are. ": "",
  "Hah! I knew I was right on the money with this one!": "",
  "I've never seen you in a skirt before.": "",
  "I.. don't normally wear them around guys.": "",
  "So that means you're comfortable around me?": "",
  "Let's just say... today's special!": "",
  "Should I be happy about that?": "",
  "Hehe. You tell me.": "",
  "(Now where should we go today?)": "",
  "How about I show you what a drone race is like?": "",
  "That'd be great! I promise I'll cheer for you!": "",
  "Why don't we hit the batting cages? I could use a little exercise.": "",
  "Okay! I could definitely go for a workout.": "",
  "Why don't we play some darts?": "",
  "If that's a challenge, then I accept!": "",
  "Better get your game face on!": "",
  "(I need to apologize to her right away.)": "",
  "Nanami-san, I'm sorry about today.": "",
  "(Of course she wouldn't answer...)": "",
  "(I should report to Yukko-san what happened.)": "",
  "This is bad, Yukko-san. Nanami-san found out.": "",
  "What did she find out?": "",
  "That we totally set her up. That it was you in disguise. Everything.": "",
  "What!? Why? I was perfectly in-character!": "",
  "There was a poster for a theater production you're appearing in... Nanami-san saw that.": "",
  "Ahhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhhh!\nNooooooooooooooo!": "",
  "Ahh! I'm so sorry! It's totally my mistake! I didn't think that poster would be in Kamurocho at all! You see, there was an injury during rehearsal and the show was put on hiatus! I thought all the posters were collected, you know? I'm sooooooo sorrry!": "",
  "No, it's my fault too. I'm the one that agreed to all this.": "",
  "Don't worry I'll explain it all to Nanami and tell her it was my doing!": "",
  "(I wonder if Yukko-san contacted Nanami-san after all. I should send her a message just in case.)": "",
  "You might have heard from Yukko-san, but I'm the one that agreed to her plan. So I'm the one at fault.": "",
  "(Nothing...)": "",
  "(I should contact Yukko-san.)": "",
  "It's no use. I'm not getting anything from her.": "",
  "Neither am I.": "",
  "I suppose we'll have to wait this one out.": "",
  "I think you're right.": "",
  "(Maybe Nanami-san will want to talk now?)": "",
  "I want to apologize about before. Can you meet tonight? I'll be waiting at the usual place at Theater Square. I'd really like it if you came.": "",
  "Yagami-san! Big trouble!! Huge trouble!!!": "",
  "What's going on? Why are you panicking?": "",
  "Something really, REALLY bad is happening!": "",
  "Can you calm down and tell me what's going on?": "",
  "It's about Nanami!": "",
  "Nanami-san? What's happening?": "",
  "A strange man is trying to take her somewhere!": "",
  "I contacted the police, but they didn't come in time!": "",
  "Could it be... the stalker that tried to kidnap Nanami-san before?": "",
  "But I thought he was arrested...": "",
  "I don't know! It's a man I've never seen! The police won't even listen to me!": "",
  "Where was it!?": "",
  "Tenkaichi Alley! In the alleyway behind Jungle Boy!": "",
  "Please! Come quickly!": "",
  "(I need to get over there, and fast!)": "",
  "Thanks for coming out today, Tsukino-chan. Let's do this again sometime.": "",
  "Sure, thanks for taking me. Hope to see you soon!": "",
  "Tsukino-chan. You can tell me about that big important thing today, if you want.": "",
  "That should be fine.": "",
  "Then I'll see you later tonight!": "",
  "(Should I ask Tsukino-chan out on a date? ...No, now's not a good time.)": "",
  "Hey, you got a minute?": "",
  "Sorry, nope.": "",
  "So you can't meet?": "",
  "Yeah, but no.": "",
  "Wtf?": "",
  "Come to the internet café.": "",
  "Yagami-san. This is Amane.": "",
  "Hey, what's going on, Amane-san?": "",
  "I merely wished to thank you. For going out of your way to believe me, not just once, but thrice.": "",
  "Well, you made the request, so I was just doing my job.": "",
  "No. Most people don't believe my predictions whatsoever, but you did. I'm very grateful for that.": "",
  "No one's ever done that much for me, so it filled my heart with joy.": "",
  "I believed you from the start": "",
  "I was a bit skeptical at first": "",
  "Of course. I believed you from the very beginning.": "",
  "Oh? Did you not mention how you were skeptical at first?": "",
  "...Did I?": "",
  "To be honest, I was a bit skeptical at first.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
